Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.75,0:00:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ants thrive in moist tropical
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.63,0:00:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,ecosystems, where they exceed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.53,0:00:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,the combined biomass of wild
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.20,0:00:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,birds and mammals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.31,0:00:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,An ant colony is a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.39,0:00:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,population of ants, typically
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.34,0:00:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,from a single species, capable
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.34,0:00:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,of maintaining their complete
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.57,0:00:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,lifecycle, with a complex
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.39,0:00:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,social hierarchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.23,0:00:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The typical colony consists of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.77,0:00:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,one or more egg-laying queens,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.99,0:00:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,numerous sterile females, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.04,0:00:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,seasonally, many winged sexual
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.18,0:00:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,males and females, including
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,workers and soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.98,0:00:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ants undertake flights to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.22,0:00:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,establish new colonies, with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.13,0:00:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,swarms of winged sexuals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.63,0:00:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,departing the nest in search
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.90,0:00:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,of other nests, a process
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.85,0:00:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,crucial for the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.53,0:00:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,colony's survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.24,0:00:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A small percentage of females
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.75,0:00:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,survive to initiate new nests,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.81,0:00:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,treating one another
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.64,0:00:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,non-aggressively, and ant
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.29,0:00:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,colonies are eusocial, communal,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.91,0:00:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and efficiently organized,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.61,0:00:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,operating as a unified entity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.40,0:00:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,to support the colony, with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.05,0:00:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,each caste playing a vital
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.61,0:00:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,role in the colony's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.76,0:00:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,overall success.